:'''Huohuo:''' Y&mdash;Yes, ma'am.
:'''Hanya:''' Sister, don't be angry. Most of your time is spent in the field &mdash; you're not accustomed to dealing with others. Leave this to me. If I explain the reasoning, they will leave.
:'''Hanya:''' As things stand, the situation in Fyxestroll Garden is sure to keep drawing attention. If we forcibly dismiss these two today, their curiosity will remain &mdash; who knows what might happen if they decide to come back. They might not be lucky enough to run into us next time.
:'''Hanya:''' As I said, sister, I will handle this.
:'''Hanya:''' I assume the two of you heard about the damage done to the Artisanship Commission's Creation Furnace? The "heliobi" sealed within escaped and have been haunting this place. The Ten-Lords Commission has orders to capture them. I am strongly advising you to leave &mdash; for your own safety.
:'''Hanya:''' If you have any questions, raise them now &mdash; I will do my best to satisfy your curiosity. But I hope you will keep any information you hear in strict confidence... and then leave Fyxestroll Garden &mdash; never to return.
:'''Guinaifen:''' Th&mdash;That's very reasonable, Your Honor! Thank you. I promise we'll leave after asking our questions.
:'''Hanya:''' As a clerk at the Hall of Karma, my knowledge on these matters is somewhat limited, but I will try my best to satisfy your curiosity. Please proceed.
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} What exactly are heliobi?
::'''Hanya:''' According to the Divination Commission's classification, they are energy parasites from the cosmos itself. They are "Starfire Essence" that materialize in the form of strange fire.
::'''Hanya:''' Metaphorically speaking, they are like moths to a flame... but that flame is the thoughts of sentient beings.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Разговор}} Are heliobi dangerous?
::'''Hanya:''' Yes. They attach themselves to sentient beings, feeding off their host's experiences and emotions.
::'''Hanya:''' A heliobus will slowly take root in its host's nervous system, using their deepest desires and weaknesses to create wild delusions. They manipulate their host like a chess piece. The host has no choice but to obey the heliobus, so we refer to it as "possession."
::'''Hanya:''' By that point, the host is no longer who they once were, but a heliobus both similar to and completely different from their past self. The host's body will soon be exhausted by the heliobus &mdash; like burnt firewood.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} So, Tail is dangerous, too?
::'''Tail:''' Dangerous!? You don't know the half of it! The other heliobi are nothing compared to me!
::'''Huohuo:''' Tail... was subdued and sealed in my tail by Madam Hanya. He won't harm others.
::'''Hanya:''' Regrettably, heliobi are not flesh-and-blood, and so they are difficult to destroy. Before the restoration of the Creation Furnace, the Ten-Lords Commission plans to set up an "Evil Binding Matrix" in this abandoned garden to imprison these abominations.
:;(Return to previous option selection)
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I don't have any other questions.
::'''Hanya:''' As you can see, the Evil Binding Matrix has not yet been completed, and not all the escaped heliobi have been recovered. This area is still very dangerous. I will ask Judge Huohuo to escort you out of the garden.
::'''Guinaifen:''' "Not all the escaped heliobi have been recovered..." So that means the other supernatural stuff that's been happening on the Luofu might be related? Your Honor! I have loads of info sources! Maybe I can help you!
::'''Xueyi:''' Unnecessary. Those not involved should leave now. Go.
::'''Huohuo:''' Um... Excuse me... We should go.
::----
{{Dialogue End}}

